#
# About page (iouston template)
#
NewClientHowItWorks = How it works
NewClientHowItWorksIntro = New customer tracking measures new customer acquisition from the signature of their first quote, and encourages sales teams with a congratulations message on every win.
NewClientHowItWorksStep1 = Enable the module: a "First quote signature date" field is added to third parties, and a "refusal type" field to quotes.
NewClientHowItWorksStep2 = In <strong>Settings</strong>, run the mass update to fill in the acquisition date of your existing customers.
NewClientHowItWorksStep3 = Choose whether to show a random image on the first signed quote or on every signed quote, and paste the list of links to your animated images.
NewClientHowItWorksStep4 = When closing a quote, set the status (signed or not signed), a note and, if the deal is lost, the reason for refusal.
NewClientHowItWorksStep5 = Follow the evolution of new customers and the revenue they generate from the <strong>New customer tracking</strong> menu.
NewClientHowItWorksNote = A customer is counted as new in the month their first quote is set to signed; the date is recorded only once and is never changed afterwards.
NewClientFeatures = Features
NewClientFeatureFirstSignature = <strong>Automatic acquisition date</strong>: the first quote signature date is recorded on the third party card.
NewClientFeatureCongrats = <strong>Congratulations on the first quote</strong>: a message celebrates the signature of a new customer, with an optional animated image.
NewClientFeatureEachSignature = <strong>Congratulations on every signature</strong>: option to also celebrate every quote signed by an existing customer.
NewClientFeatureGifList = <strong>Customizable images</strong>: you choose the list of animated images, picked at random for each message.
NewClientFeatureMassUpdate = <strong>History catch-up</strong>: a mass update fills in the acquisition date of all existing customers.
NewClientFeatureStatsByMonth = <strong>Acquisition statistics</strong>: number of new customers per month and per year.
NewClientFeatureStatsCA = <strong>New customer revenue</strong>: revenue excl. tax and number of invoices generated by customers acquired over a period.
NewClientFeatureStatsFilters = <strong>Analysis filters</strong>: filter by year, month and creating user.
NewClientFeatureRefusalReason = <strong>Reason for lost quotes</strong>: when closing an unsigned quote, a refusal type is requested and recorded.
NewClientFeatureSafeClose = <strong>Reliable closing</strong>: if another module blocks the signature (e.g. quote without a project), the error is displayed and nothing is saved.
NewClientFeatureMultiEntity = <strong>Multi-entity</strong>: new customers are calculated on the current entity, including shared third parties.
NewClientFeatureMenu = <strong>Direct access</strong>: a dedicated menu gives access to the tracking dashboard.
